 {
  coords 663.715 135.999 4460.725
  m_sTitle "SITUATION"
  m_sTextData "<b>SITUATION</b>"\
  ""\
  ""\
  "A US Armored Column Consisting of 3 Inoperative M2A3 BUSK Bradleys and 2 Inoperative M1A2 Abrams has stopped dues to a fuel shortage while retreating and we set up positions of Ambush it."\
  ""\
  "We consist of Two rifle Squads with One PHQ and Three BTR-70s For Transport and Support."\
  "The enemy defense Consists of One Rifle Squad Defending the Column and one Apaches for air support."\
  ""\
  "5 minute freeze time until we can start moving"\
  ""\
  "<b>Friendlies and Enemy CANNOT enter the Vehicles in the armored column</b>"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "GC_SEPARATIST"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
